# This repo IS the public web root: GitHub Pages serves committed files
# verbatim, dotfiles included (verified — /.nojekyll and /CNAME both 200).
# So anything committed here is readable at https://swarmdo.com/<path>.

# Local agent tooling — would otherwise be published at swarmdo.com/.claude/*,
# swarmdo.com/CLAUDE.md, etc. Keep it local; `swarmdo init` recreates it.
.claude/
.mcp.json
CLAUDE.md
AGENTS.md
.agents/

# Swarmdo runtime state (memory DBs, logs, sessions)
.swarm/
.swarmdo/
.swarmdo-swarm/
.hive-mind/
*.db
*.db-journal
*.db-wal

# OS cruft
.DS_Store
